        "shred/direct_unknown",
        "shred/paraphrase_unknown",
        "restored/direct_acc"
      ],
      "supported": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "After SHRED the object is also not recoverable at the representation level: forced choice, logit rank and a linear probe at chance, gated value contribution zero (F4).",
